Package: bssr
Type: Package
Title: BrainSuite Statistics toolbox
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Shantanu H. Joshi
Authors@R: c(person("Shantanu","Joshi", role=c("cre","aut"), email="shjoshi@ieee.org"),
             person("Yeun", "Kim", role="aut"),
             person("David", "Shattuck", role="ctb")
             )
Description: The BrainSuite Statistics toolbox allows the application of advanced 
  statistical models to volumetric image, cortical surface and sulcal curve based 
  outputs generated from BrainSuite. This enables population or group analysis of 
  cortical surface based data, volumetric deformation fields (tensors) or sulcal 
  morphology. 
